{"id":"c1e4657a556ae258","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-gl-decidable-algorithm.md","title":"GL Decidable Algorithm Corollary","display":"cor-gl-decidable-algorithm — GL Decidable Algorithm Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-gl-decidable-algorithm","aliases":["89-cor-gl-decidable-algorithm"],"display":"cor-gl-decidable-algorithm — GL Decidable Algorithm Corollary","depends_on":["[[89-thm-gl-decidable]]","[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-gl-decidable-algorithm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-gl-decidable-algorithm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gl-decidable-algorithm — GL Decidable Algorithm Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0380129bd9e48f3\" href=\"?note=f0380129bd9e48f3\" title=\"89-thm-gl-decidable\">89-thm-gl-decidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3bbdf6f3419b5805\" href=\"?note=3bbdf6f3419b5805\" title=\"89-df-gl-algorithm\">89-df-gl-algorithm</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> is the bounded finite-countermodel search function.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\bigl(\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\bigl(\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> : GL 可证性的有限反模型搜索判定器</li>\n<li>GL有有限模型性质，故可判定</li>\n<li>本推论只断言终止性与正确性，不附加未经该定义证明的精确时间界</li>\n<li>直接依赖给出同一特征函数等价式的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0380129bd9e48f3\" href=\"?note=f0380129bd9e48f3\" title=\"89-thm-gl-decidable\">89-thm-gl-decidable</a>，而不是\n只断言抽象可判定性谓词的同名定理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-gl-decidable","status":"resolved","id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-decidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-decidable","status":"resolved","id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"直接依赖给出同一特征函数等价式的 [[89-thm-gl-decidable]]，而不是\n只断言抽象可判定性谓词的同名定理。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\bigl(\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false}],"bytes":1097,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-535","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-cor-gl-decidable-algorithm]]"}],"outgoing":["f0380129bd9e48f3","3bbdf6f3419b5805"]}